---
layout: base.njk
title: Give
permalink: /donate/
description: Gifts help restore church bells and towers, pipe organs, rose windows, and stained glass. Give by check, or by card through Stripe.
---
{#- Inner-page hero (polish, 2026-09-29): the same shape as every section on the site, a plain
    h1 and one white paragraph in the 1200px column. The paragraph is the client's, verbatim. #}
<section class="section section--hero">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <h1 class="display">Give.</h1>
    <p class="section-p">Gifts help restore church bells and towers, pipe organs, rose windows, and stained glass.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{#- Online giving (client, 2026-09-29): Stripe plus check, the foundation absorbs the fee,
    receipts go out automatically. The card button is a Stripe Payment Link (Stripe's hosted
    page, nothing entered on this site). Until the link exists in src/_data/site.json the button
    is a stub that explains itself. The old amount-and-details mock is gone (git history, v2). #}
<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="wrap stack stack--lg">
    <div class="stack stack--sm">
      <h2 class="m0">By check</h2>
      <p class="section-p">To give by check, please make it payable to The DingDong Foundation, Inc. and mail it to the address in the footer. A receipt will be sent.</p>
    </div>
    {#- Quiet on purpose (Rogan, 2026-09-29): an underlined line of text, not a bright button.
        The page should feel humble. #}
    <div class="stack stack--sm">
      <h2 class="m0">Online</h2>
      <p class="section-p">Gifts by card go through Stripe's secure page. The foundation covers the processing fee, so the whole of your gift goes to the work, and a receipt is emailed to you as soon as the gift goes through.</p>
      <p class="section-p">
        {%- if site.stripePaymentLink %}
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.stripePaymentLink }}" rel="noopener">Give by card on Stripe</a>
        {%- else %}
        <button class="btn btn--ghost" type="button" data-give-stub aria-describedby="give-note">Give by card on Stripe</button>
        {%- endif %}
      </p>
      <p class="section-p" id="give-note" data-give-note hidden>Online giving opens as soon as the Stripe account is connected.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- The Lord's Prayer (client, meeting of 2026-09-23: "we can probably put the Lord's Prayer
    here", and she liked it scrolling slowly). Moved from Inspirations on 2026-10-05. The words
    are hers, verbatim, white on the page navy. Without script, or with reduced motion, the
    whole prayer simply shows. With script it drifts upward through a short window, very
    slowly; hovering it pauses it. The pause button left on 2026-10-12 (Rogan). #}
<section class="section section--page prayer">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <h2>Carried with prayer</h2>
      <p class="section-p">The work of this foundation is carried with prayer.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prayer__text" data-prayer>
      <div class="prayer__window" data-prayer-window>
        <p class="prayer__lines">Our Father, who art in heaven,<br>
hallowed be thy name.<br>
Thy kingdom come,<br>
thy will be done,<br>
on earth as it is in heaven.<br>
Give us this day our daily bread,<br>
and forgive us our trespasses,<br>
as we forgive those who trespass against us.<br>
And lead us not into temptation,<br>
but deliver us from evil.<br>
For thine is the kingdom, and the power, and the glory,<br>
for ever and ever. Amen.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
